Yaqeb
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 6 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 7 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
AND
    SRCSTACK Rank ascending
    OR
        SRC Suit {CLUBS}
        SRCSTACK Suit match
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
